#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000044
msgid ""
"She managed to escape with her life.\n"
"But her friend was not so lucky."
msgstr "她侥幸活了下来。\n但她的朋友就没那么幸运了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000045
msgid ""
"Why were they attacked? \n"
"I believe this will help explain."
msgstr "她们为何遭到袭击？\n我想这能解释清楚。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000046
msgid ""
"Perhaps they saw something \n"
"they weren't supposed to."
msgstr "也许她们看到了\n不该看的东西。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000047
msgid ""
"Perhaps they heard something \n"
"they shouldn't have."
msgstr "也许她们听到了\n不该听的东西。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000048
msgid "A cassette tape?"
msgstr "盒式磁带？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000049
msgid "Paz took this during her escape."
msgstr "帕兹逃跑时拿的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00004a
msgid ""
"She says her friend happened \n"
"to record it by accident."
msgstr "她说她朋友\n碰巧录下了这段。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00004b
msgid "What is that?"
msgstr "那啥？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00004c
msgid ""
"A portable stereo cassette player. \n"
"The first of its kind."
msgstr "便携立体声磁带机。\n同类首款。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00004d
msgid ""
"Ah. I heard they were working \n"
"on something like that in Japan. "
msgstr "啊，我听说日本\n正在研发这种东西。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00004e
msgid "Didn't know you guys were, too."
msgstr "没想到你们也在搞。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00004f
msgid ""
"I believe what you're about to hear \n"
"will help you understand."
msgstr "我想你接下来听到的\n会让你明白。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000050
msgid "What is that? A quetzal?"
msgstr "那是什么？凤尾绿咬鹃？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000051
msgid "The phoenix bird?"
msgstr "不死鸟？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000052
msgid "Paz's friend was researching birds."
msgstr "帕兹的朋友在研究鸟类。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000053
msgid ""
"She went out into the jungle to record\n"
"bird calls and stumbled upon this."
msgstr "她进丛林录鸟鸣，\n偶然录到了这个。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000054
msgid "So? So what?!"
msgstr "所以呢？那又怎样？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000055
msgid "Now it gets interesting."
msgstr "接下来才精彩。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000056
msgid "...poisonous... I... to get rid of it."
msgstr "……有毒……我……要除掉它。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000057
msgid "I chase it back to its nest."
msgstr "我把它追回巢穴。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000058
msgid ""
"You can't. The snake's too vicious. \n"
"It's... many people."
msgstr "不行。那蛇太凶了。\n它……害了很多人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000059
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227db3/0x000002
msgid "...I chase it away."
msgstr "……我把它赶走。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00005a
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227db3/0x000003
msgid "It will bite you unless you kill it."
msgstr "你不杀它，它就会咬你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00005b
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227db3/0x000004
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000006
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x629073/0x000000
msgid "Go home!"
msgstr "回家去！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00005c
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000002
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000003
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000007
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x3291f1/0x000001
msgid "Boss..."
msgstr "BOSS……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00005d
msgid ""
"Voiceprint analysis confirms that this voice \n"
"is indeed that of the legendary hero "
msgstr "声纹分析确认，这个声音\n正是传说中的英雄"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00005e
msgid " - and criminal - The Boss."
msgstr "，罪犯，THE BOSS。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00005f
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x00000f
msgid "Wh... what?!"
msgstr "什……什么？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000060
msgid ""
"The other hasn't been identified.\n"
"Female, in her thirties, with a British accent."
msgstr "另一个身份尚未查明。\n女性，三十多岁，带英国口音。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000061
msgid ""
"The song playing in the background \n"
"was a hit in 1973."
msgstr "背景播放的歌曲\n是1973年的热门曲目。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000062
msgid ""
"What's it going to be? \n"
"Loyalty to your country or loyalty to me? "
msgstr "你要怎么选？\n忠于国家还是忠于我？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000063
msgid ""
"Your country or your mentor?\n"
"Your mission or your beliefs?"
msgstr "国家还是导师？\n任务还是信念？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000064
msgid "...Boss is alive in Costa Rica?"
msgstr "……BOSS在哥斯达黎加还活着？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000065
msgid ""
"As I understand it, she was your commander,\n"
"fought by your side..."
msgstr "据我所知，她是你指挥官，\n与你并肩作战……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000066
msgid ""
"And that you killed her \n"
"under orders from the CIA... "
msgstr "而你奉CIA之命\n杀了她……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000067
msgid ""
"Thus surpassing her to become the hero\n"
"known as Big Boss."
msgstr "从而超越她，成为\n被称为BIG BOSS的英雄。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000068
msgid "Well? What'll it be? Will you take the job?"
msgstr "怎么样？接不接这活？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000069
msgid "Snake, it's gotta be a trap."
msgstr "SNAKE，肯定是陷阱。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00006a
msgid ""
"So, you still can't turn your back \n"
"on your country..."
msgstr "所以，你还是无法背弃\n你的国家……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00006b
msgid "Then I suppose you won't need this... "
msgstr "那我想你不需要这个了……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00006c
#: slot/0x00eeea4a/0x3d5431/0xd9ea26
msgid "Wait!"
msgstr "等等！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00006d
msgid "Snake?"
msgstr "SNAKE？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00006e
msgid "I'll do it for the girl. For Paz."
msgstr "我接，为了那女孩。为了帕兹。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00006f
msgid "OK... For peace, then."
msgstr "确定……那就为了和平。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af56d/0x325ef1/0x000000
msgid ""
"Yes, sir, we broke 'im. We've acquired\n"
"the whereabouts of target five-zero-zero."
msgstr "是，长官，我们撬开了他的嘴。已掌握\n目标五零零的下落。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af56d/0x525ef3/0x000000
msgid "Acknowledged. "
msgstr "收到。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af56d/0x525ef3/0x000001
msgid ""
"TJ-Chrysalis 6000, \n"
"proceeding to secure target five hundred..."
msgstr "TJ-蝶蛹 6000，\n前往确保目标五百……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af56d/0x525ef3/0x000002
msgid ""
"Spears are loaded. \n"
"The barge has cleared Point Bravo."
msgstr "矛已装填。\n驳船已通过B点。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af56d/0x525ef3/0x000003
msgid "Acknowledged. Out."
msgstr "收到。完毕。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af58d/0x625f73/0x000000
msgid "...Freeze!"
msgstr "……不许动！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af58d/0x625f73/0x000001
msgid "The cargo, where's it headed? What is it?!"
msgstr "货物要运去哪？是什么东西？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af58d/0x625f73/0x000002
msgid "Urk... Irazu... In the mountains..."
msgstr "呃…伊拉苏…在山里…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af58d/0x625f73/0x000003
msgid "What's up there?"
msgstr "上面有啥？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x226012/0x000000
msgid ""
"The cargo's heading from the marshes\n"
"west toward Irazú."
msgstr "货物正从沼泽地\n往西运向伊拉苏。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x226012/0x000001
msgid "Nice going, Boss."
msgstr "干得好，BOSS。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x226012/0x000002
msgid ""
"Kaz... this place is full of film badges.\n"
"Dozens of them."
msgstr "卡兹…这地全是胶片佩章。\n几十个。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x226012/0x000003
msgid ""
"...Film badges? Like the ones used\n"
"to measure radiation exposure?"
msgstr "胶片徽章？就是那种用来\n测量辐射暴露的？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x226012/0x000004
msgid "The radio man was wearing one."
msgstr "那无线电兵就戴着。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x496013/0x000000
msgid ""
"And whoever he was talking to\n"
"called the cargo \"spears.\""
msgstr "跟他通话的人把货物\n叫成\"矛\"。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x496013/0x000001
msgid "Wait, that would mean..."
msgstr "等等，那不就…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x496013/0x000002
msgid "Nukes."
msgstr "核弹。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x496013/0x000003
msgid "They're bringing nukes into Costa Rica."
msgstr "他们要把核弹运进哥斯达黎加。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x496013/0x000004
msgid "Holy mother of God..."
msgstr "我的老天……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x72600f/0x000000
msgid "This is Snake. Kaz, can you hear me?"
msgstr "我是SNAKE。卡兹，听到吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x72600f/0x000001
msgid "Loud and clear. You found a radio?!"
msgstr "一清二楚。你找到无线电了？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x72600f/0x000002
msgid "It's got a circuit that reverses the audio phase."
msgstr "它有个能反转音频相位的电路。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x72600f/0x000003
msgid ""
"Let's switch frequencies from time to time...\n"
"Just to make sure we're not detected."
msgstr "我们时不时换个频率吧……\n确保不被发现。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x72600f/0x000004
msgid "I found a map of their bases."
msgstr "我找到了他们基地的地图。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000000
msgid ""
"Have you seen a big transport boat, \n"
"mercenary crew, on the Río del Jade?"
msgstr "你在翡翠河上见过一艘大型运输船吗，\n上面是雇佣兵？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000001
msgid "You mean the barge? It's upstream from here."
msgstr "你说那艘驳船？就在这上游。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000002
msgid "Up toward Irazu."
msgstr "往伊拉苏方向。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000003
msgid "Any idea what's on it?"
msgstr "知道装了啥吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000004
msgid ""
"I could introduce you to\n"
"some of our compas up there. "
msgstr "我可以把你介绍给\n上面的一些弟兄。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000005
msgid ""
"But I don't recommend going to \n"
"the mountains. We've lost a lot of people there."
msgstr "但我不建议去\n山里。我们在那里损失了很多人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000006
msgid ""
"They take us captive, torture us for \n"
"information about our compas... "
msgstr "他们抓了我们的人，拷问\n弟兄们的情报……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000007
msgid "and then they kill us like pigs."
msgstr "然后他们像杀猪一样杀了我们。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000008
msgid ""
"...This was our last hideout.\n"
"The final refuge for el Frente"
msgstr "...这是我们最后藏身处。\nel Frente最后避难所"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000009
msgid "after being pushed out of Nicaragua"
msgstr "在被赶出尼加拉瓜之后"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x00000a
msgid "and into this \"peaceful paradise\" of Costa Rica."
msgstr "逃进哥斯达黎加这个\"和平天堂\"。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x00000b
msgid "Then el monstruo attacked..."
msgstr "然后el monstruo袭击了..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x00000c
msgid "A Monster?"
msgstr "怪物？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x00000d
msgid "Y mi viejo..."
msgstr "还有我的老家伙..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000000
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x0000ae
msgid "I owe you one."
msgstr "我欠你一次。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000001
msgid "But, I prefer cigarettes, you know."
msgstr "不过，我更喜欢香烟，你知道的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000002
msgid "How do I look? A little like El Che, no?"
msgstr "我看起来怎么样？有点像El Che吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000003
msgid "You Cubano?"
msgstr "你是古巴人？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000004
msgid ""
"Colombiano. A photographer. I came to\n"
"Costa Rica to take pictures of birds."
msgstr "哥伦比亚人。摄影师。我来\n哥斯达黎加拍鸟。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000005
msgid "Birds?"
msgstr "鸟？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000006
msgid "Yea umm... Quetzals."
msgstr "嗯...凤尾绿咬鹃。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000007
msgid ""
"You've got no telephoto lens.\n"
"How do you get your shots?"
msgstr "你连长焦镜头都没有。\n你怎么拍的？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000008
msgid "Telephoto's for amateurs. It's all in the timing."
msgstr "长焦是给外行用的。全靠时机。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x7960fe/0x000000
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x00002a
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000090
msgid "Get down!"
msgstr "趴下！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000000
msgid "Quien es?"
msgstr "Quien es？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000001
msgid "El Che?"
msgstr "El Che？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000002
msgid "No way."
msgstr "不可能。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000003
msgid "What do we do?"
msgstr "怎么办？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000004
msgid "Sandinistas, right?"
msgstr "桑地诺派，对吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000005
msgid "I'm looking for someone."
msgstr "我在找一个人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000006
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000050
msgid "Mi viejo..."
msgstr "我的老家伙..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000007
msgid "He's dead."
msgstr "他死了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000008
msgid "They killed nuestro viejo."
msgstr "他们杀了老首领。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000009
msgid "You're his daughter?"
msgstr "你是他女儿？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x00000a
msgid ""
"Then that makes you \n"
"his delegada (representative), right?"
msgstr "那你就是他的\ndelegada（代表），对吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x00000b
msgid "Relax, I'm not your enemy."
msgstr "放松，我不是你的敌人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x00000c
msgid "Cuban?"
msgstr "古巴人？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x00000d
msgid "Hmph... A Cigar?"
msgstr "哼……来根雪茄？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x00000e
msgid "I'll take whatever you've got. "
msgstr "你有什么我都抽。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000000
msgid "Mi viejo, papá... He was la esperanza - our hope."
msgstr "我的老首领，爸爸……他曾是la esperanza——我们的希望。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000001
msgid ""
"Now that papá's gone, my sister is \n"
"la comandante de la revolucion."
msgstr "爸爸走了，现在姐姐是\nla comandante de la revolucion。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000002
msgid "Do not listen to him. "
msgstr "别听他的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000003
msgid ""
"Papá was a hero who fought by Sandino's side. \n"
"I am only his daughter."
msgstr "爸爸是跟桑地诺并肩作战的英雄。\n我只是他的女儿。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000004
msgid "You need a special talent to become cacique. "
msgstr "要成为cacique得有特殊才能。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000005
msgid "It takes someone great to unite all of las compas."
msgstr "得是了不起人才能团结所有las compas。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000006
msgid ""
"Sorry to interrupt, but leaders don't choose \n"
"themselves. Neither do heroes."
msgstr "抱歉打断，但领袖不是自封的。\n英雄也不是。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000007
msgid ""
"You carry on his legacy of la esperanza, \n"
"and they'll follow you. No question."
msgstr "你继承他的la esperanza遗志，\n他们就会追随你。毫无疑问。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000008
msgid ""
"You think so? My compas trust me, \n"
"but not one of them calls me comandante."
msgstr "你这么想？我的compas信任我，\n但没一个叫我comandante。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000009
#: slot/0x003af62d/0xa2620f/0x000000
#: slot/0x003af90d/0x905660/0x000000
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000000
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00005d
msgid "Amanda!"
msgstr "阿曼达！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x00000a
msgid "See what I mean?"
msgstr "明白我的意思了吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x00000b
msgid "El colibri!"
msgstr "El colibri！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000000
msgid "Let me smoke too!"
msgstr "也让我抽一口！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000001
msgid "We can talk until I finish this."
msgstr "抽完这根前聊聊。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000002
#: slot/0x003af60d/0x326173/0x000002
msgid "Chico!"
msgstr "奇科！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000003
msgid "Tell me what's going on here."
msgstr "告诉我这怎么回事。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000004
msgid ""
"This place is crawling with soldiers.\n"
"They don't look like private security. "
msgstr "这地方到处都是士兵。\n他们不像私人安保。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000005
msgid ""
"More like hired guns. They're loaded with\n"
"the latest gear from all over the world."
msgstr "更像雇佣兵。他们装备着\n世界各地最先进的武器。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000006
msgid ""
"I heard they're a security force\n"
"hired by CODESA."
msgstr "听说他们是由CODESA\n雇佣的安保部队。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000007
msgid ""
"Yeah, and I'm Papá Noel.\n"
"Those guys are UCLAs."
msgstr "是啊，我还是圣诞老人呢。\n那些家伙是UCLA。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000008
msgid ""
"UCLAs (Unilaterally Controlled Latino Assets)\n"
"... la CIA?"
msgstr "UCLA（单方面控制的拉美资产）\n……CIA？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000009
msgid "I saw them setting up shop in town. "
msgstr "我看见他们在镇上扎营。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x00000a
msgid ""
"They're planning to do here\n"
"what they did in Chile."
msgstr "他们打算在这里\n重演智利的勾当。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x00000b
msgid "If that's the case, what are they after?"
msgstr "若真如此，他们图什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x00000c
msgid "Whatever it is, it's not us..."
msgstr "不管图什么，反正不是我们……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x00000d
msgid ""
"You don't think they're here to \n"
"push you back into Nicaragua?"
msgstr "你觉得他们不是来\n把你赶回尼加拉瓜的？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x00000e
msgid "Impossible. Too much hardware - too many bases."
msgstr "不可能。装备太多，基地太多。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x00000f
msgid ""
"Didn’t you see? They've got helicopters,\n"
"tanks... It's like we're in Da Nang."
msgstr "你没看见吗？他们有直升机、\n坦克……简直像在岘港。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000010
msgid " There must be something else."
msgstr "肯定另有目的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000011
msgid "They have a base near here?"
msgstr "他们附近有基地？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000012
msgid ""
"There's a factory to the north, \n"
"across a suspension bridge."
msgstr "北边有座工厂，\n过一座吊桥就是。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000013
msgid "Factory to the north, across a bridge."
msgstr "北边工厂，过桥即到。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0x326173/0x000000
msgid "What the hell?!"
msgstr "搞什么？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0x326173/0x000001
msgid ""
"Es un hombre nuevo. An unmanned weapon.\n"
"A robot!"
msgstr "Es un hombre nuevo。无人兵器。\n机器人！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0x726176/0x000000
msgid "No! He won't survive the fall!"
msgstr "不！他摔下去会死的！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0x726176/0x000001
msgid "Out of my way!"
msgstr "让开！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0x726176/0x000002
msgid ""
"Better for him to die at the hand of \n"
"a compa than suffer their torture."
msgstr "与其受他们折磨，\n不如死在同志手里。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0xa96192/0x000000
msgid ""
"Stay here. As long as I'm still alive, \n"
"I might as well repay you."
msgstr "待在这。只要我还活着，\n就该报答你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0xa96192/0x000001
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x00001b
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000081
#: slot/0x00db94df/0x814381/0x000000
msgid "Over here!"
msgstr "这边！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0xa96192/0x000002
msgid "Find Chico! ¡Venceremos!"
msgstr "找到奇科！¡Venceremos！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af62d/0x3261f1/0x000000
msgid "Intruder detected. Intruder detected."
msgstr "发现入侵者。发现入侵者。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af62d/0x3261f1/0x000001
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x0001f7
msgid "Commencing attack."
msgstr "开始攻击。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af62d/0x326213/0x000000
msgid "Shoot it!"
msgstr "开枪打它！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af62d/0x326213/0x000001
msgid "You'll fall!"
msgstr "你会掉下去的！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af62d/0x326213/0x000002
msgid "Shoot el Chicolibri!"
msgstr "射杀蜂鸟！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af90d/0x901a62/0x000000
#: slot/0x003af90d/0x901e5e/0x000000
msgid ""
"I will take my own life before I sell out \n"
"my compas under torture!"
msgstr "我宁死也不会在酷刑下\n出卖同伴！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af90d/0x902662/0x000000
msgid "What are you aiming at? El chicolibri!"
msgstr "你在瞄什么？蜂鸟！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000001
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000007
msgid "Chico..."
msgstr "奇科……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000002
msgid "What? What is it?"
msgstr "什么？怎么了？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000003
msgid "Can you... roll me one?"
msgstr "你能……给我卷一根吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000004
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr "嗯？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000005
msgid "Tobacco..."
msgstr "烟草…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000006
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000010
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000006
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000002
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x00000e
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00005d
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "嗯。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000008
msgid "Hold still."
msgstr "别动。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000009
msgid "I treated him like a kid again... we fought."
msgstr "我又把他当小孩，我们吵了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x00000a
#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000071
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr "嗯？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x00000b
msgid "I didn't want Chico to know... Kept it a secret."
msgstr "我不想让奇科知道……一直瞒着他。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326e59/0x000000
msgid "Kaz, can you hear me?"
msgstr "卡兹，能听到吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326e59/0x000001
msgid "MSF here."
msgstr "MSF收到。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326e59/0x000002
msgid "One for recovery. She's wounded."
msgstr "一人回收。她受伤了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326e59/0x000003
msgid "Acknowledged."
msgstr "收到。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326e59/0x000004
msgid ""
"Kaz, the cargo on the barge... I was right, \n"
"it's headed for the mountains."
msgstr "卡兹，驳船上的货物……我猜对了，\n正运往山里。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326e59/0x000005
msgid "You think that's where they're taking the nukes?"
msgstr "你觉得核弹被送到那里了？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326e59/0x000006
msgid "I'm sure of it. Let's move."
msgstr "我确定。行动吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000000
msgid "A front. It's a drug refining plant."
msgstr "是个幌子。其实是毒品提炼厂。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000001
msgid "The KGB set it up for us to run."
msgstr "克格勃建起来让我们经营的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000002
msgid "We use the income to buy food and weapons..."
msgstr "我们用收入买粮食和武器……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000003
msgid "Mi viejo never said a word, but we all knew."
msgstr "我爸从没提过，但我们都心知肚明。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000004
msgid "Ooh... everyone except Chico."
msgstr "唔……除了奇科，所有人都在。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000005
msgid "Everything we have... Our weapons, our compas..."
msgstr "我们的一切……武器、战友……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000006
msgid "He brought it all together..."
msgstr "是他把大家聚到一起……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000007
msgid "We were going to rebuild our country..."
msgstr "我们本想重建祖国……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000008
msgid "rebuild Nica with our own hands..."
msgstr "亲手重建尼加拉瓜……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000009
msgid "even if we had to dirty our hands to do it... "
msgstr "哪怕双手沾满污秽……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x00000a
msgid "But it's all over. We lost our cacique. Papá..."
msgstr "但一切都完了。我们失去了首领。爸爸……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x00000b
msgid "I could never replace him..."
msgstr "我无法取代他……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x00000c
msgid ""
"Now they've taken the plant from us, too... \n"
"There's no place left to regroup..."
msgstr "现在他们连工厂也夺走了……\n再没有地方可以重整旗鼓……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x00000d
msgid "No way to fight la revolución..."
msgstr "没法继续革命了……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x00000e
msgid "Here... I rolled you one."
msgstr "给……我给你卷了一根。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x00000f
msgid "What about you? You're going after that cargo?"
msgstr "你呢？你要去追那批货？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000011
msgid "Must be important, mmm?"
msgstr "一定很重要吧，嗯？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000012
msgid "Looks that way."
msgstr "看来是。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000013
msgid "It... Looks like it could be nukes..."
msgstr "那……像是核弹……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000000
msgid ""
"There's a prison up in the mountains... \n"
"That's probably where he is."
msgstr "山里有个监狱……\n他大概就在那里。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000001
msgid "A prison in the mountains..."
msgstr "山里的监狱……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000002
msgid ""
"You must do something for me.\n"
"If you... can't save Chico..."
msgstr "你得帮我做件事。\n如果你……救不了奇科……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000003
msgid ""
"I want you to... ease his pain... \n"
"End his humiliation..."
msgstr "我要你……减轻他的痛苦……\n结束他的屈辱……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000004
msgid ""
"If he gives in, if he's about to sell out \n"
"his compas... Please..."
msgstr "如果他屈服，如果他要出卖\n战友……求你……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000005
msgid "...At least let him keep his honor."
msgstr "……至少让他保住尊严。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000006
msgid "That's a promise I can't make."
msgstr "这个承诺我做不到。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000007
msgid "...Why?"
msgstr "……为什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000000
msgid ""
"Amanda, we gave up our homes. \n"
"But we're still alive."
msgstr "阿曼达，我们没了家园。\n但还活着。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000001
msgid "We're still fighting."
msgstr "我们还在战斗。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000002
msgid ""
"And there's always another reason \n"
"to keep on living."
msgstr "而且总有另一个理由\n让人活下去。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000003
msgid "Ahh, I feel alive again..."
msgstr "啊，我又感觉活过来了……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000004
msgid "Amanda, join my unit until you've healed up."
msgstr "阿曼达，伤好前加入我部队吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000005
msgid "Your... unit?"
msgstr "你的……部队？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000007
msgid "Who are you? Why are you here?"
msgstr "你是谁？为何在这？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000008
msgid "...I'm Snake. Serpiente."
msgstr "……我是SNAKE。Serpiente。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000009
msgid "\"Snake?\""
msgstr "“SNAKE？”"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x00000a
msgid "Could it be..."
msgstr "难道……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x00000b
msgid "the great cacique..."
msgstr "伟大的酋长……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x00000c
msgid "has come to lead us..."
msgstr "来带领我们……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x00000d
msgid "patria libre o morir... "
msgstr "自由祖国或死亡……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000000
msgid "Wha-? Nukes?!"
msgstr "什么——？核弹？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000001
msgid ""
"¡Madre de dios! No time to waste!\n"
"We must get to Irazú!"
msgstr "圣母啊！没时间了！\n必须去伊拉苏！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000002
msgid "The transport route leads there."
msgstr "运输路线通向那里。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000003
msgid ""
"It must be where they're holding Chico\n"
"and my compas, too..."
msgstr "他们一定把奇科\n和我的同志们关在那里……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000004
msgid ""
"Whenever Chico and I argue, \n"
"he goes off to be by himself..."
msgstr "每次奇科和我吵架，\n他都一个人跑出去……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000005
msgid ""
"That's why he knows more than \n"
"anybody about their bases."
msgstr "所以他比谁都清楚\n他们的基地。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000006
msgid "He... Oh, Chico..."
msgstr "他……哦，奇科……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000007
msgid "You're pretty worried about your baby brother."
msgstr "你很担心你的小弟弟。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000008
msgid "This is why I'm not fit to be a leader..."
msgstr "这就是我不配当领袖……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000009
msgid "Fine. It's a little bit out of my way, but..."
msgstr "好吧。虽然有点绕路，但是……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x00000a
msgid "Just tell me where I need to go."
msgstr "只要告诉我该去哪儿就行。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0xb26e10/0x000000
msgid "Somoza's guardia chased us out of Nicaragua,"
msgstr "索摩查的国民卫队把我们赶出尼加拉瓜，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0xb26e10/0x000001
msgid "across the Rio San Juan... and we ended up here."
msgstr "越过圣胡安河……最后到了这里。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0xb26e10/0x000002
msgid ""
"The only reason \n"
"we've been able to keep on fighting..."
msgstr "我们之所以\n能一直战斗下去……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0xb26e10/0x000003
msgid "Amanda?"
msgstr "阿曼达？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0xb26e10/0x000004
msgid "The factory... You saw it?"
msgstr "那个工厂……你看到了？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0xb26e10/0x000005
msgid "The banana factory..."
msgstr "香蕉工厂……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af952/0x326e85/0x000000
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000266
msgid "Curses!"
msgstr "可恶！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000000
msgid "Wh... who's there...?"
msgstr "谁……谁在那儿……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000001
msgid "Chico? It's me."
msgstr "奇科？是我。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000002
msgid "You're..."
msgstr "你是……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000003
msgid "You're that... photographer?"
msgstr "你是那……摄影师？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000004
msgid "That's right, a war photographer."
msgstr "没错，战地摄影师。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000005
msgid "Huh? I thought you were here for the birds."
msgstr "咦？我还以为你是来拍鸟的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000006
msgid "Yeah, uh, the birds of the battlefield."
msgstr "对，呃，战场上的鸟。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000007
msgid "Whoa, is that... Che's?"
msgstr "哇，那是……切的东西？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000008
msgid "Can I see it?"
msgstr "能让我看看吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000009
msgid "Wow! The same kind el Che used!"
msgstr "哇！和切用的一样！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00000a
msgid "You can't keep it, kid. Here, have these instead."
msgstr "小子，这不能给你。来，这些给你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00000b
msgid "Those photos?"
msgstr "那些照片？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00000c
msgid "Oh no... Amanda!"
msgstr "糟了……阿曼达！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00000d
msgid "She's safe. Don't worry."
msgstr "她没事。别担心。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00000e
#: slot/0x0083b291/0xff8cbc/0x44a048
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr "你确定？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00000f
msgid "We're patching her up back at my place."
msgstr "我们正在我那儿给她包扎。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000010
msgid "She's hurt?!"
msgstr "她受伤了？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000011
msgid "...I said don't worry. It's just a broken leg."
msgstr "……我说了别担心。只是腿断了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000012
msgid "...You got any cigarettes?"
msgstr "……你有烟吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000013
msgid "A cigar, huh..."
msgstr "雪茄，是吧……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000014
#: slot/0x00420130/0x649bfd/0x000000
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000183
msgid "Hey!"
msgstr "喂！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000015
msgid "It's not for kids."
msgstr "这不是小孩子该知道的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000016
msgid "Chico, do you know where they took the cargo?"
msgstr "奇科，他们把货运哪了？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000017
msgid "Cargo? What cargo?"
msgstr "货物？什么货物？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000018
msgid ""
"...Let me rephrase that. \n"
"How do they get stuff from the coast up here?"
msgstr "……换个问法。\n他们怎么把东西从海岸运上来？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000019
msgid "Oh, that I can tell you."
msgstr "哦，这我能说。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00001a
msgid ""
"When the cargo gets to the harbor, \n"
"they first send it up the marshes on a barge."
msgstr "货物到了港口后，\n先用驳船沿沼泽运上来。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00001b
msgid ""
"Then they load it onto a jungle train \n"
"past the banana plantation"
msgstr "然后装上丛林列车，\n穿过香蕉种植园"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00001c
msgid "and transport it by rail."
msgstr "再经铁路运输。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00001d
msgid ""
"The train stops here. When it gets to \n"
"the train terminal past the coffee plantation, "
msgstr "列车停在这里。等它开到\n咖啡种植园那边的终点站，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00001e
msgid "they reload it again, this time onto a truck "
msgstr "他们又换一次车，这次装上卡车"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00001f
msgid "which disappears into a tunnel heading toward the mountains."
msgstr "卡车就消失在通往山里的隧道中。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000020
msgid "Disappears?"
msgstr "消失？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000021
msgid "Chico, what's on the other side of that tunnel?"
msgstr "奇科，那条隧道另一头是什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000022
msgid ""
"Nobody knows.\n"
"None of our compas ever got close enough..."
msgstr "没人知道。\n我们的人从没靠近过……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000023
msgid "It's protected by a spirit."
msgstr "那里有恶灵守护。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000024
msgid "...A spirit."
msgstr "……恶灵。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000025
msgid "Yeah. A giant monster."
msgstr "对。一只巨怪。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000026
msgid "...El basilisco."
msgstr "……蛇怪。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000027
msgid "The king of snakes...?"
msgstr "蛇中之王……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000028
msgid ""
"No, no, no, really, I saw it! \n"
"I was camping up there one day, "
msgstr "不不不，真的，我见过！\n有天我在上面露营，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000029
msgid ""
"and just as I was waking up around dawn, \n"
"I heard this loud noise."
msgstr "黎明时刚醒过来，\n就听到一声巨响。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00002a
msgid "I opened my eyes and saw an enormous shadow."
msgstr "我睁眼看到个巨影。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00002b
msgid "Must have been 30 vara (80 ft) at least."
msgstr "至少有30巴拉（80英尺）。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00002c
msgid "...It was walking. On legs as big as trees."
msgstr "……它在走。腿跟树一样粗。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00002d
msgid "Where did you see it?"
msgstr "你在哪看到的？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00002e
msgid ""
"At the terminal near the tunnel. \n"
"But I only saw it that one time."
msgstr "在隧道附近的终端。\n但我只见过那一次。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00002f
msgid "What exactly were you doing there?"
msgstr "你在那里到底做什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000030
msgid "I, uh... Well, me and my sister got into a fight."
msgstr "我，呃……我和我姐姐吵了一架。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000031
msgid "And you just \"happened\" to go camping?"
msgstr "你就“碰巧”去露营？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000032
msgid "You know, "
msgstr "你知道，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000033
msgid ""
"their train should be arriving at the place \n"
"I saw el basilisco right about now!"
msgstr "他们的火车现在应该快到\n我看到el basilisco的地方了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000034
msgid "Is it far?"
msgstr "远吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000035
msgid ""
"Not really. Go past the coffee plantation \n"
"and it'll be to the north."
msgstr "不算远。过了咖啡种植园，\n就在北边。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000036
msgid "What are you chasing?"
msgstr "你在追什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000037
msgid ""
"Something that could keep the world \n"
"in balance... or destroy it."
msgstr "能维持世界平衡……\n也能毁灭世界的东西。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000039
msgid ""
"I heard that place was a narcotics plant \n"
"before those guys took it over. "
msgstr "我听说那地方在那些人接手前\n是个毒品工厂。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00003a
msgid "But, you already knew that, didn't you."
msgstr "不过，你早就知道了，对吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00003b
msgid ""
"Look, I get it. \n"
"Even revolutionaries need to pay the bills."
msgstr "听着，我明白。\n革命者也得付账单。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00003c
msgid "Still, must be tough for a kid like you to swallow."
msgstr "不过，你这种孩子还是很难接受吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00003d
msgid ""
"You're damn right it is!\n"
"The route they use to transport stuff "
msgstr "你说得没错！\n他们运货的路线"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00003e
msgid "is the same one mi viejo used to smuggle drugs."
msgstr "就是mi viejo以前走私毒品的路线。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00003f
msgid "They sold the drugs to the norteamericanos "
msgstr "他们把毒品卖给norteamericanos，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000040
msgid "and used the profits to fund the army."
msgstr "用赚来的钱供养军队。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000041
msgid "They tried to keep it hidden from me."
msgstr "他们想瞒着我。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000042
msgid "Is that why you went \"camping\"?"
msgstr "所以你去“露营”了？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000043
msgid "Yes..."
msgstr "是的……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000044
msgid ""
"I managed to sneak into the plant \n"
"a few times and..."
msgstr "我设法溜进了工厂\n几次，然后……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000045
msgid "...I tried to set it on fire."
msgstr "……我想烧了它。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000046
msgid "...Everyone treats me like a child."
msgstr "……大家都把我当小孩。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000047
msgid ""
"I, I, I couldn't stand it anymore. \n"
"I'm not a kid. I'm twelve! "
msgstr "我，我，我再也受不了了。\n我不是小孩。我都十二岁了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000048
msgid "Couldn't do it though, could you?"
msgstr "可你做不到，对吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000049
msgid ""
"Chico, growing up means choosing how you're\n"
"gonna live your life."
msgstr "奇科，长大就是选择自己要怎样\n度过一生。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00004a
msgid "To do the right thing,"
msgstr "要做正确的事，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00004b
msgid ""
"you sometimes have to leave the things \n"
"you care about behind"
msgstr "有时你不得不舍弃\n你所珍视之物"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00004c
msgid "parents, family, your homeland."
msgstr "父母、家人、故乡。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00004d
msgid "But mi viejo..."
msgstr "可我的老爹……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00004e
msgid "Papá..."
msgstr "爸爸……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00004f
msgid "Chico...Look at the photos."
msgstr "奇科……看照片。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000051
msgid "Treasure your memories, Chico. "
msgstr "珍惜你的回忆，奇科。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000052
msgid "No matter what happens, keep them safe."
msgstr "不管怎样，护好它们。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000053
msgid "You wanna get out of here, Chico?"
msgstr "你想离开这里吗，奇科？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000054
msgid "I do but... "
msgstr "想，可是……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000055
msgid "Come back with me. Your sister's waiting for you."
msgstr "跟我回去吧。你姐姐在等你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000056
msgid "I can't go back... I can't face everybody..."
msgstr "我回不去……没脸见人……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000057
msgid "...You told them where your compas are?"
msgstr "……你供出了你的同伴？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000059
msgid ""
"Nothing to be ashamed of.\n"
"Pain gets the better of us all."
msgstr "没什么好羞耻的。\n痛苦谁都扛不住。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00005a
msgid "...I wish I was dead."
msgstr "……我真希望自己死了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00005b
msgid "OK, then, I'll put you out of your misery."
msgstr "好，那我就让你解脱。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00005c
msgid "Wha-?!"
msgstr "什么？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00005d
msgid "Any last words?"
msgstr "有什么遗言吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00005e
msgid "\"Shoot, you are only going to kill a man.\""
msgstr "“开枪吧，你不过杀一个人。”"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00005f
msgid "I just wasted a bullet. Don't waste your life."
msgstr "我只浪费一颗子弹。别浪费命。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000060
msgid ""
"Listen to me, Chico. You died here today.\n"
"You understand?"
msgstr "听我说，奇科。你今天死在这了。\n懂吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000061
msgid ""
"You're hombre nuevo. A new man.\n"
"Now, give that new life to me."
msgstr "你是新人。全新的人。\n把新命交给我。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000062
msgid ""
"Fight with me, little soldier.\n"
"Show me how strong you really are."
msgstr "跟我打，小士兵。\n让我看看你多强。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000063
msgid "Dry your tears, then promise me one thing."
msgstr "擦干眼泪，然后答应我一件事。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000064
msgid "No smoking until you get older."
msgstr "长大之前不许抽烟。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000065
msgid ""
"Remember, real heroes are never as polished \n"
"as the legends that surround them."
msgstr "记住，真正的英雄从来不像\n围绕他们的传说那样完美。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000066
msgid "You got it, Boss."
msgstr "明白，BOSS。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000067
msgid "Snake is fine."
msgstr "叫我SNAKE就行。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000068
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x00000f
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr "那是什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000000
msgid "This is the one. "
msgstr "就是这辆。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000001
msgid "The exhaust's still warm."
msgstr "排气管还是热的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000002
msgid "...But the cargo's already been offloaded."
msgstr "……但货物已经卸走了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000003
#: slot/0x003af992/0x226fab/0x000001
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr "什么都没有。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000005
msgid "Where are they?"
msgstr "他们在哪？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000006
msgid "Ahhh..."
msgstr "啊啊……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000007
#: slot/0x003af992/0x226fab/0x000005
msgid "Metal...Gear..."
msgstr "合金……装备……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000008
msgid "SUN LIGHT!"
msgstr "阳光！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000009
#: slot/0x003af992/0x226fab/0x000007
msgid "Mr. Kojima!"
msgstr "小岛先生！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x326f75/0x000000
msgid ""
"Kaz, I'm inside the facility. \n"
"There's rows and rows of trucks here."
msgstr "卡兹，我进到工厂里了。\n这里停着一排排的卡车。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x326f75/0x000001
msgid ""
"If that's where they brought the nukes, \n"
"then the truck we're after should be there. "
msgstr "如果核弹被运到了这里，\n那我们要找的卡车应该就在。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0xa26f77/0x000000
msgid ""
"Snake, can you tell which one of \n"
"the trucks brought the nukes? "
msgstr "SNAKE，你能分辨出是哪辆\n卡车运来了核弹吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0xa26f77/0x000001
msgid ""
"One of them must have the same license plate \n"
"as the one from the terminal."
msgstr "其中一辆的车牌一定和\n终端那辆一样。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af992/0x226fab/0x000000
msgid "Damn it! You found me!"
msgstr "该死！你找到我了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af992/0x226fab/0x000004
msgid "Ahhh... "
msgstr "啊啊……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af992/0x226fab/0x000006
msgid "SUN LIGHT"
msgstr "阳光"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af992/0x326f89/0x000000
msgid ""
"Kaz, I'm inside the facility.\n"
"There're rows and rows of trucks here."
msgstr "卡兹，我进到工厂里了。\n这里停着一排排的卡车。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af992/0x326f89/0x000001
msgid ""
"Zadornov should be somewhere in that area. \n"
" Find him."
msgstr "扎多尔诺夫就在那片区域。\n找到他。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x227036/0x000000
msgid "You used me."
msgstr "你利用了我。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x227036/0x000001
msgid ""
"We used each other. \n"
"I'll get my old Director's job back at headquarters,"
msgstr "我们互相利用。\n我会回总部官复原职，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x227036/0x000002
msgid ""
"and you'll finally be able to \n"
"\"walk tall\" among your colleagues."
msgstr "而你终于能在同事中\n\"昂首挺胸\"了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x227036/0x000003
msgid "Rgh... I won't let you get away with this!"
msgstr "呃……我不会让你得逞的！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x227036/0x000004
msgid ""
"How unfortunate.\n"
"Guess I'll just have to take your \"legs\" for myself!"
msgstr "真遗憾。\n那我只好夺走你的\"腿\"了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000000
msgid "Just a minute! This isn't what we agreed on!"
msgstr "等等！这跟我们说好的不一样！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000001
msgid ""
"It's too late. \n"
"The changes have already been finalized."
msgstr "太迟了。\n变更已经敲定了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000002
msgid ""
"You told me it was going to be a deterrent,\n"
"that we wouldn't have to launch!"
msgstr "你说过那只是威慑，\n我们不必真的发射！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000003
msgid ""
"I am not arguing with you, Doctor.\n"
"Our goal is to create the perfect deterrent."
msgstr "我不是跟你争，博士。\n我们要造完美威慑。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000004
msgid "That's why I agreed to help develop it... "
msgstr "所以我才答应帮忙开发的……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000005
msgid ""
"Mm-hmm. However, in order to achieve\n"
"that perfect deterrent, "
msgstr "嗯哼。不过，要实现\n那完美的威慑，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000006
msgid "we must show the world our strength."
msgstr "我们必须向世界展示实力。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000007
msgid ""
"Three key principles ensure effective\n"
"nuclear deterrence."
msgstr "确保有效核威慑的\n三大原则。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000008
msgid "First, you must have nuclear weapons."
msgstr "第一，必须拥有核武器。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000009
msgid "Second, you must never use them first."
msgstr "第二，绝不首先使用。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x00000a
msgid "And third, and most important..."
msgstr "第三，最重要……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x00000b
msgid "If someone attacks you, you must strike back."
msgstr "若遭攻击，必须予以反击。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x00000c
msgid ""
"Unless we prove beyond a doubt that these\n"
"three principles work in practice, "
msgstr "除非我们证明这三项原则\n确实行之有效，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x00000d
msgid "the world will not accept our new deterrent."
msgstr "否则世界不接受新威慑。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x00000e
msgid "And the only way to do that "
msgstr "而唯一的办法"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x00000f
msgid ""
"is to show them we're capable of\n"
"actually launching a nuke."
msgstr "就是让他们看到我们\n真能发射核弹。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x427058/0x000000
msgid "W-wait!"
msgstr "等、等等！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x427058/0x000001
msgid "Hey, you OK?"
msgstr "喂，你没事吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x427058/0x000002
msgid "Don't do it..!"
msgstr "别这样！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x427058/0x000003
msgid "Snap out of it! Where are the nukes?"
msgstr "清醒点！核弹在哪？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x427058/0x000004
msgid "He's going to do it!"
msgstr "他真要动手！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000000
msgid ""
"Your creation? That thing wasn't\n"
"even your idea to begin with."
msgstr "你的作品？那东西一开始\n就不是你的主意。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000001
msgid "You stole it, didn't you?"
msgstr "是你偷的，对吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000002
msgid "...S-stole it? You're one to talk! "
msgstr "……偷的？你还有脸说！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000003
msgid ""
"You got the idea for bipedal locomotion\n"
"from the Communists in the first place!"
msgstr "双足行走的点子\n本来就是从共产党那里弄来的！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000004
msgid "You listen to me, doc! Keep quiet. Do as I say. "
msgstr "听我说，博士！闭嘴。照我说的做。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000005
msgid "And not another word about stolen ideas."
msgstr "不许再提偷点子的事。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000006
msgid ""
"Should we succeed here, you'll be the toast \n"
"of the scientific community..."
msgstr "只要这里成功，你就是科学界的\n风云人物……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000007
msgid "...And your name'll go down in history"
msgstr "……你的名字将载入史册"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000008
msgid ""
"as champion of both progress \n"
"and national security!"
msgstr "成为进步与国家安全的\n双重捍卫者！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000009
msgid "The hell with that!"
msgstr "去他的！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x00000a
msgid "Doctor!"
msgstr "博士！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x00000b
msgid "Unless we prove we're capable of launching, "
msgstr "除非我们证明有能力发射，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x00000c
msgid "Peace Walker is useless as a deterrent."
msgstr "和平行者作为威慑毫无用处。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x62705a/0x000000
msgid "He's gonna launch a nuke!"
msgstr "他要发射核弹！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x927011/0x000000
msgid ""
"But... isn't deterrence supposed \n"
"to stop nukes from being used...!"
msgstr "可是……威慑不就是为了\n阻止核弹被使用吗……！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x927011/0x000001
msgid ""
"Exactly. And so the one we launch \n"
"will be the last one ever!"
msgstr "没错。我们发射的\n将是史上最后一枚！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x927011/0x000002
msgid "I won't let you use my creation like that!"
msgstr "我不会让你那样用我的作品！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0xa27054/0x000000
msgid "...Peace won't just come to us, doc."
msgstr "……和平不会自己找上门，博士。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0xa27054/0x000001
msgid "We are going to have to go meet it halfway."
msgstr "我们得主动迎上去。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0xa27054/0x000002
msgid "V for victory."
msgstr "V代表胜利"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000000
msgid ""
"That was an unmanned weapon... a prototype. \n"
"I made it myself."
msgstr "那是个无人兵器……原型机。\n是我亲手做的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000002
msgid "I work here. Well, used to, anyway. Name's Huey."
msgstr "我在这里工作。不过以前是。我叫休伊。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000003
msgid ""
"And who might you be? \n"
"You don't look like one of those mercenaries."
msgstr "你是哪位？\n看起来不像那些雇佣兵。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000004
msgid "Me? I'm... an entomologist."
msgstr "我？我是……昆虫学家。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000005
msgid "A... fighting... entomologist?"
msgstr "一个……战斗……昆虫学家？"
